{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOBulletListV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"MISOBulletList","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Bullet list is a UI element that helps to view in related individual text items grouped together; items usually starting with a number or a bullet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bullet list is also known as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered list"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered list"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and is not an interactive element by default.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Item"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Type","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/UnorderedAsset"],"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOBulletList","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/ContentDisplay"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Types","text":"Types","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three types are proposed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items that don’t need to be in a specific order or sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items with numeric order or sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bare"}]},{"type":"text","text":": An unordered list without any bullets or alphanumeric sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types can be mixed in list, but must be identical for the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOBulletList.NestedLevel"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Levels","text":"Levels","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists can include nested items to indicate hierarchy or subcategories, with indentation distinguishing each level."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Arrange ordered list items logically, such as ranking by importance, highest to lowest values, or in alphabetical \/ numeric order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Three levels are maximum."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Text-Style","text":"Text Style","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List can be used with different font sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Large"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Large text. This variant is designed for more visual, engaging experiences."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Medium"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Medium text. This variant is best suited for functional, task-oriented experiences."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it is not allowed to have a depth of items greater than 3"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Internationalisation-considerations","text":"Internationalisation considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For latin-based speaking countries, like France, Spain, United Kingdom or Belgium, the european “arabic” numbers are used for the first level of depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the ordered bullet list. For the second and third levels, the european alphabets are used with upper and lower case values."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"However for countries speaking arabic, these rules can’t be applied. Indeed, there is no notion of upper and lower case characters in arabic alphabet."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the numbers in use (i.e. the european “arabic” numbers like “1, 2, 3”) are accepted in arabic countries, even if the “true arabic” numbers (like “ ٢ ٣ ١”) are used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in middle-east arabic countries and for official documents."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus the MISO ordered bullet list will use “european” numbers for first level, and arabic alphabets for second and third levels."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["       \/\/ 1. Unordered list with bullets","       MISOBulletList {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 1.1. Item of Unordered list with bullet as tick, a text style","       \/\/ body medium and text bold","       MISOBulletList(type: .unordered(asset: .tick),","                      textStyle: .bodyMedium,","                      isBold: true)  {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 2. Bare list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .bare) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3. Ordered list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3.1. Ordered list with 3 items in first level,","       \/\/ and one item as sub item (second level),","       \/\/ and 2 items as sub item in (third level)","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\") {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ Same Bullet list but items in third level with free icon as bullet","       let icon = Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\", subListType: .unordered(asset: .icon(icon))) {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Rich-text-recommendations","text":"Rich text recommendations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be applied for bullet list whatever the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isBold"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly within alert messages to highlight key information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be used for emphasis, as it is commonly associated with links."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined links must be bold."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a hyperlink is needed within the content, the underlined style should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Italic should be used with care, some brands do not allow it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 1.2.0"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/TextStyle":{"title":"MISOBulletList.TextStyle","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The typography style for the list item"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TextStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/textstyle","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"t